    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010STORY\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A non-human, living alone in the night of London.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One evening, he meets a girl seeking help in the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has lost her memories and knows not why she is there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In saving her from the darkness, the two become fast friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The non-human, wishing to help his very first friend recover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her memories, makes for two beings he has heard about by</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >way of rumors among the fae: the Thorn Mage Elias, and Chise.</p>",
